O <z_touch_retract> sub
    M65 P00
    G10 L20 P0 Z0	(set current Z = 0)
    G91      		(switch to relative coordinates)
    
    M64 P00
    G38.4 Z1 F8	(probe up using a fast feedrate)
    M65 P00

    G92 Z1.692 		(set Z = plate thickness)
    G0 Z0.1
    G0 Z-.2 F6	        (move down by 0.1mm)
    M64 P00
    G38.4 Z.22 F2        (2nd pass: probe up using a slow feedrate to get better accuracy)
    M65 P00
    G92 Z1.692	   	(set Z = plate thickness)
    G90		        (switch to absolute coordinates)
    G0 Z2.0 F10	        (move to 10mm above work piece)

O <z_touch_retract> endsub
